{
  "settings": {
    "introImage": {
      "src": "img/lo7/opinions-matter.svg",
      "alt": "Opinions matter illustration"
    },
    "introHTML": "<p>This lesson teaches learners how to express likes, dislikes, and preferences in French using verbs such as <em>aimer</em>, <em>adorer</em>, <em>détester</em>, and <em>préférer</em>. It introduces sentence patterns for talking about activities, sports, and favourite things, and shows how to use definite articles with general nouns (for example <em>j&apos;aime le football</em>, <em>je n&apos;aime pas la natation</em>). Learners also practise interrogative adjectives (<em>quel</em>, <em>quelle</em>, <em>quels</em>, <em>quelles</em>) to ask questions, and work on pronunciation of words borrowed from English like <em>le tennis</em>, <em>le foot</em>, and <em>le week-end</em>.</p>",
    "informationHTML": "<p><strong>After completing this unit, you will be able to:</strong></p><ul><li>Talk about likes, dislikes, and preferences in French.</li><li>Use common verbs such as <em>aimer</em>, <em>adorer</em>, <em>détester</em>, and <em>préférer</em> with greater confidence.</li><li>Use definite articles more accurately when talking about sports, activities, and general things.</li><li>Ask and answer questions about favourite activities, colours, and countries.</li><li>Recognise how some words borrowed from English are pronounced in French.</li></ul>"
  },
  "dialogues": {
    "component": "Section",
    "expandable": false,
    "informationTextHTML": "<p>This section introduces short dialogues that show how French speakers talk about likes, dislikes, favourite things, and preferred activities.</p>",
    "content": [
      {
        "dialogues1": {
          "component": "PhraseTable",
          "id": "dialogues1",
          "informationTextHTML": "<p>Read each phrase, then play its audio clip to check pronunciation and meaning.</p>",
          "phrases": [
            [
              "audio/lo7/dialogues/013-vous-aimez-le-rugby-guillaume.mp3",
              "Vous aimez le rugby, Guillaume ?",
              "Do you like rugby, Guillaume?"
            ],
            [
              "audio/lo7/dialogues/006-le-rugby-ah-non-je-deteste-le-rugby-et-vous-qu-est-ce-que-vous-aimez-comme-sports.mp3",
              "Le rugby ? Ah non ! Je déteste le rugby ! Et vous, qu'est-ce que vous aimez comme sports ?",
              "Rugby? Oh no! I hate rugby! What about you, what sports do you like?"
            ],
            [
              "audio/lo7/dialogues/005-je-suis-tres-sportif-j-aime-beaucoup-le-rugby-et-le-foot-j-aime-aussi-le-squash-et-le-badminton.mp3",
              "Je suis très sportif ! J'aime beaucoup le rugby et le foot. J'aime aussi le squash et le badminton.",
              "I like rugby and football very much. I also like squash and badminton."
            ]
          ],
          "titleText": "Talking about favourite sports"
        }
      },
